{
  "file" : "npc/custom/events/holiday/valentinesdayexp.txt",
  "scripts" : [
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The legend says that on 14th February... on the Day of Saint Valentine...",
      "translation" : "傳說每到2月14日...也就是聖瓦倫丁節..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Only in Run-Midgard kingdom...",
      "translation" : "在盧恩·米德加茲王國..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Some married chocolate lovers almost double their experience at trainings!",
      "translation" : "有些喜歡巧克力的已婚人士，在訓練時能獲得將近雙倍的經驗值！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But everything isn't so simply...",
      "translation" : "不過，事情可沒那麼簡單..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wow! Tell me more!",
      "translation" : "哇！快告訴我更多！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Marri... what?",
      "translation" : "結...什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you a single?",
      "translation" : "你是單身嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Today is a great date to ask your beloved half for marriage!",
      "translation" : "今天正適合向你的另一半求婚！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Marriage fee is ridiculous low these days!",
      "translation" : "現在的結婚費用低得離譜！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The magic effect possesses only handmade chocolate from grand-grand-grand-whoever recipes!",
      "translation" : "只有用不知傳了多少代的祖傳秘方製作的手工巧克力，才有這種魔法效果！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It being known that Black Handmade Chocolate works on married guys... And the White one on the married girls!",
      "translation" : "據說黑色手工巧克力對已婚男性有效...白色手工巧克力則對已婚女性有效！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you lose your wedding ring... then alas, it won't work on you.",
      "translation" : "要是弄丟了結婚戒指...唉，那就對你沒用了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "On having a Chocolate, you should put off your ring then... put it back... And if your partner is online, then magic would last till the next hour!",
      "translation" : "拿到巧克力後，先摘下戒指...再戴回去...如果你的伴侶線上，魔法效果就會持續到下一個整點！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Rumors bark that guys and gals have +50% EXP bonuses on FIVE different races of the monsters... Excluding bloody bosses, of course.",
      "translation" : "據說男女雙方對五種不同種族的魔物都能獲得+50%的經驗值加成...當然，那些該死的Boss不算。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Tine]",
      "translation" : "[蒂內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Tine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's a famous confectioner in the Castle of Prontera! He's the one you need.",
      "translation" : "普隆德拉城堡裡有位著名的糖果師！你要找的就是他。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Guess what I've got?",
      "translation" : "猜猜我有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A tasty treat not easily found in Midgard....",
      "translation" : "在米德加茲可不容易找到這樣的美味..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Chocolate!",
      "translation" : "巧克力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "That's right, don't you love chocolate.... I do.",
      "translation" : "沒錯，你喜歡巧克力吧...反正我喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And you are in luck, because I'm selling them for only 5,000 zeny a piece!",
      "translation" : "你可走運了，我這裡每塊只賣5,000 Zeny！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want some chocolate!",
      "translation" : "我想要巧克力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't want any chocolate?",
      "translation" : "你不想要巧克力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm telling you! You'll regret it!",
      "translation" : "我告訴你！你會後悔的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You better get some now... you won't come across Chocolate like this ever again!",
      "translation" : "你最好現在買一些...再也遇不到這樣的巧克力了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Think it over and visit me again sometime.",
      "translation" : "好好考慮一下，改天再來找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hah!",
      "translation" : "哈！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I knew it!",
      "translation" : "我就知道！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I can't sell you more than 5 at once....but, if you really need more....",
      "translation" : "不過我一次最多隻能賣5塊...要是你真的還想多買..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "you can come back again.",
      "translation" : "可以再來找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So how many do you want?",
      "translation" : "那麼你要幾塊？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There you go!",
      "translation" : "給你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can give that to someone as a gift, or enjoy it yourself!",
      "translation" : "你可以把它送給別人，也可以自己享用！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mmm....sweet chocolate...",
      "translation" : "嗯...甜甜的巧克力..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Visit me anytime...!",
      "translation" : "隨時歡迎再來...！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry but I can't give you that many.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，我不能給你那麼多。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Stephen]",
      "translation" : "[斯蒂芬]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Stephen",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm sorry but it seems you can't afford to buy these of me.",
      "translation" : "抱歉，看來你買不起我的巧克力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know what? The chocolate that my boyfriend sells are from me!",
      "translation" : "你知道嗎？我男朋友賣的巧克力都是我做的！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I made them by myself. Now I need some Milk for my special White Chocolate.",
      "translation" : "都是我親手做的。現在我需要一些牛奶來製作特製白巧克力。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You know ... In certain countries, there's a tradition of presenting chocolates to a person that you love...",
      "translation" : "你知道嗎...在某些國家，人們有向心愛的人贈送巧克力的傳統..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "They call it ^3355FFValentine's Day^000000.",
      "translation" : "他們稱之為^3355FF情人節^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So I gave him my delicious chocolate...",
      "translation" : "於是我把自己做的美味巧克力送給了他..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And then he made me cook a lot more...",
      "translation" : "結果他讓我又做了好多..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And now he is selling them to everyone.",
      "translation" : "現在他還把巧克力賣給大家。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I guess he really enjoyed it.",
      "translation" : "看來他真的很喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But, I do feel good when people buy something I have made.",
      "translation" : "不過，看到有人願意買我做的東西，我還是很開心的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It would be great if you bought some too...",
      "translation" : "如果你也買一些就好了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I will be making white chocolates for a while so...",
      "translation" : "我最近會一直做白巧克力，所以..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want some white chocolate!",
      "translation" : "我想要白巧克力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No thanks.",
      "translation" : "不用了，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't like white chocolate?",
      "translation" : "你不喜歡白巧克力嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then buy some Stephen's black one!",
      "translation" : "那就買些斯蒂芬的黑巧克力吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I can't sell you more than 5 at once....but, if you really need more....",
      "translation" : "不過我一次最多隻能賣5份...要是你真的還想多買..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "you can come back again.",
      "translation" : "可以再來找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So how many do you want? 1 portion is 4500z + 1 Milk.",
      "translation" : "那麼你要幾份？每份需要4,500 Zeny和1瓶牛奶。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jainie]",
      "translation" : "[傑妮]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Jainie",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There you go!",
      "translation" : "給你！"
    },
    {
